WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:03.150
SCP-682 Vs SCP-702.

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.910
Who would win?

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:08.809
The Hard to Destroy Reptile or the gaseous
living embodiment of the “trade offer”

00:00:08.809 --> 00:00:09.809
meme?

00:00:09.809 --> 00:00:10.809
Let’s find out.

00:00:10.809 --> 00:00:16.380
When the gaseous entity inside SCP-702 suddenly
appeared, the researchers offered SCP-682

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.280
to it as a gift.

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:22.880
702 briefly considered the offer for around
thirteen minutes, before disappearing with

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:26.510
the monster, leaving a cage with a parakeet
in it in return.

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:32.330
702 later returned 682 after it ate several
other curious items in its vast collection,

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:36.399
considering it to be more trouble than it’s
worth - Something the Foundation can definitely

00:00:36.399 --> 00:00:37.399
relate to.

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:39.999
The parakeet is still kept in Dr. Quater’s
office.

